config HI1102_WIFI
	tristate "HiSilicon Hi1102 SDIO Wi-Fi driver (Kirin 710)"
	depends on MMC && CFG80211
	help
	  Wi-Fi driver for HiSilicon Hi1102 SDIO connectivity chipships on
	  Kirin 710 platforms (e.g. Huawei P30 lite) with modern cfg80211
	  WPA3-SAE and 802.11w PMF support.
